L $entry ]] || continue\n    name=${entry##*/}\n\n/usr/share/omarchy/themes/nord/unlock.png PNG 800x188 800x188+0+0 8-bit sRGB 2512B 0.000u 0:00.000", "prev": "b607ce105fbc6428319070442b779dda6048229e8d28304ed9162b8eb8027c80", "hash": "773e64c050eb34fc77d0771bbdb158c4de84ce66fe8b906b798941ecc7ce7ff6"}
